{"slug":"realistic-tree-behaviour","name":"Realistic Tree Behaviour","description":"Realistic Tree Behaviour makes trees fall with physics + sounds, clearing foliage they hit, and bouncing slightly before settling back into blocks. It keeps the tree intact during the fall for a more natural, realistic yet vanilla feel.","author":"Hac","icon_url":"https://cdn.modrinth.com/data/GWBnsWKG/cb30bcb08b87c1e7c29f7d164b8fe692641d8910.png","download_count":301,"supported_versions":[{"name":"1.21.11","channel":"release"}],"supported_loaders":[{"id":"fabric","name":"Fabric"}]}